# ==============================================================================
#  Profile: common - applies to every repository, whatever its stack.
#  Composed by scripts/Set-CopilotIgnore.ps1 (see profiles.json).
#  Content Exclusion applies the union of all profiles to every repository,
#  case-insensitively: each rule must be safe for every stack.
# ==============================================================================

# --- [common] Lock files ------------------------------------------------------
# Machine-written dependency graphs; the manifests next to them are what matter.
**/package-lock.json
**/npm-shrinkwrap.json
**/yarn.lock
**/pnpm-lock.yaml
**/bun.lock
**/packages.lock.json
**/poetry.lock
**/Pipfile.lock
**/uv.lock
**/pdm.lock
**/go.sum
**/Cargo.lock
**/composer.lock
**/Gemfile.lock
**/gradle.lockfile
**/.terraform.lock.hcl

# --- [common] Minified bundles and source maps --------------------------------
**/*.min.js
**/*.min.css
**/*.js.map
**/*.css.map

# --- [common] Generated API descriptions and generated-code folders -----------
**/swagger*.json
**/openapi*.json
**/[Gg]enerated/**

# --- [common] Localization catalogs -------------------------------------------
**/*.xlf
**/*.xliff
**/*.po
**/*.pot
**/[Ll]ocales/**
**/i18n/**/*.json

# --- [common] Database migration history --------------------------------------
# EF Core, Django, Laravel, TypeORM, Knex... The current model lives elsewhere.
**/[Mm]igrations/**

# --- [common] Seed data, fixtures and bulk data -------------------------------
# Exclude the data, NOT the code that loads it.
**/*.csv
**/*.tsv
**/*.jsonl
**/*.ndjson
**/*.geojson
**/*.data.json
**/*[Ss]eed*.json
**/[Ss]eed*/**/*.json
**/[Ss]eed*/**/*.xml
**/[Tt]est[Dd]ata/**/*.json
**/[Tt]est[Dd]ata/**/*.xml
**/[Ff]ixtures/**/*.json
**/*[Ss]eed*.sql
**/[Ss]eed*/**/*.sql
**/*.data.sql
**/*[Dd]ump*.sql
**/[Rr]eference[Dd]ata/**/*.sql

# --- [common] Heavy documentation and diagrams --------------------------------
# Markdown (README, ADRs) is kept: it does help Copilot.
**/_site/**
**/docs/**/*.html
**/*.pdf
**/*.docx
**/*.pptx
**/*.xlsx
**/*.vsdx
**/*.svg
**/*.drawio
**/*.dio
**/*.bpmn
**/*.puml
**/*.plantuml
